sequenceDiagram
    actor User as 专家
    participant Agent as CodeActV2
    participant Registry as 版本与作用域
    participant Worker as 隔离worker
    User->>Agent: 先研究某个子集
    Agent->>Worker: 任意Python生成划分结果
    Worker-->>Agent: 保存子集与脚本
    Agent->>Registry: 登记D1，父集D0，源码/参数/理由
    Registry->>Registry: 不可变内容 + current=D1, stack=[D0]
    Agent->>Worker: 关闭旧进程，DATASET=D1
    Worker-->>Agent: 子集结果与DatasetRef
    Agent->>Registry: 登记并选择D2
    Registry->>Registry: current=D2, stack=[D0,D1]
    Note over Registry: 进程恢复读取同一SQLite作用域
    User->>Agent: 回到上一范围
    Agent->>Registry: return parent
    Registry-->>Agent: current=D1
    User->>Agent: 回到主数据
    Agent->>Registry: return root
    Registry-->>Agent: current=D0，D1/D2仍保留
